WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:38.670
I didn't think you'd be such a disappointment.

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.200
After all the special treatment I've given you...

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.220
Volkov-sama, I beg of you!

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:45.950
I... I won't lose again!

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.630
You're pathetic!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.260
Mr. Volkov!

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.100
Volkov!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.050
Help...

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.330
I beg of you!

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.250
Help me...

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:57.770
Please, help me!

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.370
Help me!

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:06.560
Help meeeeee!

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:11.440
Did you have a bad dream?

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:14.750
You're not looking too good.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:24.750
The Door to Unpleasant Memories

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:29.790
Yummy!

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.340
Pirozhki is the best... Borscht's the best...

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.010
Russia's <i>the</i> best!

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:38.970
Not that it matters, but I'm surprised
you can eat so much at this hour.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.070
Don't give me that crap, Professor!

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.690
You can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:46.330
You should know that the first step
toward being a strong Blader is eating well!

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.210
Even then...

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.090
It's all-you-can-eat!

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.720
Are you two still at it?

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.680
We're already done eating.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:55.200
Rei! Max!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.030
Where's Kai?

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.810
He went and left early.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.240
Again?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.990
Right, but...

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.500
No, it's nothing.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:06.130
See you later.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.420
Huh? Where are you off to?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.700
I'm gonna take a walk around Moscow.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.680
I'll be doing a little training, myself.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.500
Training?

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.560
I see!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.960
In Russia—or more specifically, here in Moscow—

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.180
there are lots of squares and parks,

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:24.820
like the Red Square, Manezhnaya Square, and Gorky Park!

00:03:25.090 --> 00:03:27.810
As such, among Russian kids, each of these places

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.600
have become their own Beyblading grounds!

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:31.140
Is that right?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:34.030
I guess Rei wants to see how well they match up, then!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:35.530
Most likely.

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.960
No time to waste.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.160
We're going, too!

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:39.980
This is no time to be stuffing our faces!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.470
Weren't you the one eating?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.130
Why did I have that dream?

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.980
Back there...

00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:00.080
My heart ached as if something pulled at it.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.720
Such a disgusting feeling...

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:10.000
I almost can't even bear seeing my own
reflection. This sensation... what the heck is it?

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.010
Okay, I'm next! Here goes!

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:17.870
You won't make it!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.050
Whoa!

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:37.910
Mama...

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:42.630
I'm now in Russia to partake in
the World Championship's Finals.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:47.510
There may be many unusual buildings, but I still
feel the warmth of the people and their lifestyle.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:51.430
If we win in the finals, I'd love
to come back here with you.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.910
Aw... you ran a little too fast, there.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.850
It'll all be okay. Can you stand?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.590
Yup!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.700
Mama?

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.250
Max?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.340
<i>Mama</i>!

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.350
Max!

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.350
I missed you so much, Mama!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.000
I missed you, too, Max.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.630
To think I caught you here...
I must be dreaming!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.800
Oh, if it isn't Max!

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:24.750
It's been a while.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.640
Have you been well?

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.670
Everyone!

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:28.580
Why..?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.150
Why are you all here?

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:33.320
We were invited by Mr. Volkov!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.210
By Volkov-san?

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.370
Before the Finals kick off,

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:41.780
Mr. Volkov has decided to hold a training match.

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.740
We were invited over with that in mind.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.480
Even a peek behind Russia's mysterious veil

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.040
is a <i>chance</i> we can't refuse!

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.800
I've heard that other teams
across the world were invited, too!

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.160
From across the world...

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.080
Could that mean...

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:10.220
No matter the country you're in, Beyblade's still popular.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:14.650
Wow!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:16.770
Who are these guys?

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.000
Over already?

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.410
So weak.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:29.190
We came all this way
from our village to see <i>this</i>?

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.140
Can't complain when the food's nice, though.

00:06:32.440 --> 00:06:33.450
We're going, Mao.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.770
We've nothing to gain from showing
off the White Tiger Clan's power.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:48.810
Go, Galux!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.400
I knew you'd be here, Rei-nii!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.220
Russian for "Thank you"
<i>Spasibo!</i>

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.440
Woah, look at 'em go!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.500
I'm itching for some action!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.620
In fact, Russia is the country with
the highest population of Bladers.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:24.960
That's why they were chosen
to hold the World Championship's Finals, so...

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:26.430
Basically,

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:28.960
There's a <i>ton</i> of super-strong guys here!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.990
I'm getting fired up!

00:07:31.390 --> 00:07:32.320
Now, then!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:35.230
Who should I have a go at?

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:35.920
Takao!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.400
Max!

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:39.950
It's you!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.840
The PPB Team!

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.700
Nice to see you again, Professor-kun.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:44.860
Likewise....

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:47.990
Are you still lugging that toy of yours around?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.420
Keep your data up here, or it's pointless.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.060
Even your opening lines are wonderful...

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.320
H-H-Hold the phone!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.420
What are you all doing here?

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:59.300
A training match?

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.670
Mr. Volkov wanted to introduce teams
from all over the world to one another.

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.240
That old guy?

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:05.990
Yes.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.760
That's why we were invited, as well.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:10.930
Lai!

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:12.680
The Chinese Team!

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:15.090
It's been quite some time, Takao.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.450
We heard the news!

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.830
You guys made it all the way to the Finals, huh?

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.480
A pleasant surprise!

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:23.220
To think the Byakko Clan would leave their village...

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:26.050
Following the Asian Tournament, the village changed.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:29.250
The Elder allowed us to go out
and see the world, like Rei.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:32.400
I never thought I'd see
everyone all together here!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.600
I'm so happy!

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.030
Let me introduce you!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.790
This is the Chinese Team.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:42.760
And here you'll find the PPB Team, representing America.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.050
Nice to meet you.

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:44.970
Same here.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:45.960
Emily.

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.840
Are these guys strong?

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.070
There's no data.

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:50.860
In other words,

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.640
I don't think they're anything special.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.040
Hey, you!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.270
What'd you just say?

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:58.560
That we aren't anything special?

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.600
So what about your team, then?

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.690
Lay off them, Mao.

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:03.640
Sorry.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:04.750
She doesn't mean harm.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.320
Emily's in charge of data analysis, so...

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:10.440
And what I'm hearing is that this data analysis of hers

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.780
isn't actually all that useful.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.070
Come again?!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.000
What is it?

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.000
Now now, you two, calm down.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.120
The PPB is a very science-oriented team.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.160
They may look cold on the outside,

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.750
but they're good people!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.890
The White Tiger Clan has been kept
from the outside world for a long time.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.410
That's why there's no data on them.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.840
Don't fight, you guys!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:38.310
I know better than anyone that
you're all strong and great people.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:39.810
Takao!

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:42.560
Still, I am the strongest here!

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:47.670
We're way stronger than we were last time!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.400
How about a battle, then?

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.070
Hey, don't go and... ah, ah, ah!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.680
Always the <i>funny boy</i>.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:09:58.300
He kept us from fighting.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:59.590
Indeed.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:00.220
And yet...

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:04.190
I <i>am</i> interested in finding
out which one of us is stronger.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:05.490
How about it?

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.960
Would you mind having
a little diplomatic battle?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:13.220
<i>Okay</i>.

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:14.300
We accept.

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:17.530
I approve of your match!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.140
What is that uneasy feeling?

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.140
If I don't know what it really is,

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.860
I'll find out for myself!

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.370
W-What's this?!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:29.830
An underground...

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:31.930
secret research facility?!

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:06.170
We will now hold an official special match
between the Chinese Team and the PPB Team!

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:10.840
Make sure to get plenty of data, Emily.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:14.140
Yes, I'll gather data on their power levels.

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.990
I don't know much about science,

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:20.460
but I'll show you what happens
when you underestimate the Chinese.

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.300
Now..! Both Bladers, step forward!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.890
Let's get started! Ready?

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.600
Three! Two! One!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.600
Go... Shoot!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.730
Well! The heat on this match is totally cranked up!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.840
Both of them are looking for an opening!

00:12:38.840 --> 00:12:41.280
I won't show mercy just because you're a girl!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.490
Tryhorn!

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.970
I'll show you the awesome
might of a raging bull.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.280
Death Rush!

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.080
There it is!

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.460
Steve's special move!

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.120
The mighty Death Rush!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:59.290
You'd have to be joking to
think that'll finish me off.

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.410
What?!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:01.790
Go, Galux!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:04.260
What is this?!

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.320
Catty Bites!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.820
Look out!

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:11.770
Tryhorn gets a <i>stadium out</i>!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.600
Mao is the winner!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.120
She cleverly turned the tables for a win!

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.650
Some raging bull you are..!

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.490
More like cattle, if you ask me.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.340
Now, the Chinese Team has won the first set!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:34.710
Will the next one be their last?

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.930
Or will the PPB turn it around?

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.680
The second set will be between Gao

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.840
and Eddie!

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:43.340
Hold on, Eddie.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:45.660
Will you let me handle this one?

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.170
What?

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.940
I'm a member of the PPB Team, too.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.850
Sometimes I want to battle.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:53.590
Please, Director.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:55.300
I suppose I can't stop you.

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.050
All yours.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:57.610
Thanks.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:01.630
What's this? The PPB Team has switched players!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:04.490
Emily has taken Eddie's place!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.960
Get over to the other side, Professor!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.880
Right, time for the second set!

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:16.960
Ready?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.570
Three! Two! One!

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:19.580
Go Shoot!
Three! Two! One!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:21.300
Go Shoot!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.570
What's the meaning of this?

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.780
There's a Beyblade
research lab under the abbey...

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:32.800
Moreover,

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.700
the heck is this uneasy feeling?

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:42.280
What <i>is</i> this?!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.670
T-This...

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.780
It couldn't be..!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.290
Are they researching Sacred Beasts' Bits?!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:18.040
Galzzly is out!

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.160
Incredible!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:22.690
Emily wins the second set
with her amazing strength!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.570
Lai-nii! Tear 'em to pieces!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.420
Don't get so emotional.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.940
You needn't worry.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:34.780
I will not dishonor the Byakko Clan.

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.520
Onto the third set! Teams are tied, one-to-one!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:40.300
Will the Chinese Team claim victory?

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:42.760
Or will it be the PPB Team?

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:45.760
Rai and Michael will battle to the end!

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:49.000
I knew it would come down to the captains.

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.760
Their aura is completely different.

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.190
Look!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:54.560
Michael's got the glove on his left hand!

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.190
He's pitching with his right?

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:58.060
Michael's not holding back.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:01.640
I can feel their fightin' spirit from here...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.980
So awesome!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.650
It's just an exhibition match, but
we've both got pride on the line.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.760
Let's give it our all.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:11.200
Of course. Anything else would be a disservice.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:15.040
The third set! Ready?

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.080
Three! Two! One!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.460
Go Shoot!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.420
<i>Cannonball Maximum</i>!

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.440
Galeon!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.940
Whoa! Galeon's been blown away!

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.650
Will it be knocked out of the park?!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.690
What's that?! Galeon's back for a counter!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.730
Nimble, like a wild animal!

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.220
You survived my right-handed pitch!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:52.860
I'm impressed.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.570
This is only the beginning.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.050
Those voices...

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:02.810
Their chilling cries...

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:03.540
Right.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.050
It's..!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.680
16,352!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:12.690
16,353!

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:15.900
16,354!

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.010
16,355!

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:21.710
You stopped.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.900
You don't have the right to be a Blader.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.130
We will confiscate your Bey.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:28.640
16,356!

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.380
We're increasing the speed of this
machine to get some data on your endurance.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:41.660
We're not done here. According to the
simulation, you'll perform fine at this weight.

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.220
He is your enemy.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:48.510
You must hate him.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:51.660
Force your pain and suffering into your Bey.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:54.050
Destroy his Bey!

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.840
The captains don't disappoint!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.740
The two of them are in an
unrelenting back-and-forth!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.200
This is what Beyblading is all about!

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.720
He's actually a match for Rai...

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:20.020
I can't believe they're this even.

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:21.990
He's good!

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.960
Make sure to get data on them, Emily.

00:18:24.960 --> 00:18:27.330
Data on these superb Bladers.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:27.990
Yup.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:31.610
Wow...

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:35.160
Both are way stronger than they used to be..!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.920
They've grown!

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.800
Time to end this. Galeon!

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:44.750
Take this! Dark Lightning!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.000
There it is!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.640
Lai's special move!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:51.150
What..?!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.090
It's stopped!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:54.970
Trygle stopped it in its tracks!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.120
Time to fight back, Trygle!

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:17.460
A simultaneous <i>stadium out</i> for both Bladers!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:18.640
Our match ends in a draw!

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.040
That was a good fight.

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:28.570
Yeah.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.490
The exhibition match between
the Chinese and PPB Teams is a draw!

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:44.090
That was an awesome battle, guys!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.230
Everyone's gotten so much more powerful

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:48.290
since the last time we fought.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.140
Sorry about that.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.100
I wanted it to be a casual ordeal,

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.730
but I got a little too into it.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.120
It's cool!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.920
We enjoyed ourselves,

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:59.360
and made some good friends to boot.

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:01.690
Well, except for a certain someone...

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:08.530
Let's meet again for a training match.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:09.440
Yeah.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.150
Then and there, we'll end this.

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.230
See you, Takao, Rei.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:17.400
We'll have our revenge for the
American tournament next time we fight.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:19.610
You bet! Bring it!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.440
Aren't you guys missing someone?

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.390
Yeah, the really strong one.

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:30.710
What happened to Kai?

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.500
Come to think of it...

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.170
That's it...

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:42.270
I remember.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.950
I remember why I feel so uneasy.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:48.420
I...

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:50.890
I used to...

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:00.900
Help me...

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.140
Please, help me!

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.120
I'm begging you, please!

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.360
Please help me!

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.750
Please help me!

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:13.500
Long time no see, Kai-kun.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:16.550
It's all coming back to you, isn't it?

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:19.640
Yes.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.010
It's me.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:24.930
I...

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.680
I used to...

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.640
live here!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:02.040
According to my calculations, his memories have returned.

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:05.550
The terrifying past that lied within Kai's memories.

00:23:06.700 --> 00:23:10.800
The BBA Team sneaks into the Abbey to search for Kai.

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:15.550
But a Blader with cold-hearted gaze stands in our way.

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:17.060
It's Ivan!

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:20.060
Next time: One Who Desires the Strongest.

00:23:20.310 --> 00:23:22.060
I'vant much to say here.

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:24.680
Brrr... Russia won't warm up to me.
